				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7e67465c-613c-58e9-a07e-4200ad97c546")
	)
	(text "6 x TNPV1206 1.00 M (167 V each at 1000 V) + 4.99 k: 1 V = 1203 V, clip 1504 V. 4.7 nF: lag\n<= 27 us incl. AMC3330. Out: VBX_P/N (+/-2 V on 1.44 V, PORT contract). HGND = BUS-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.968 104.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "93564733-c511-5dcc-b918-8c5c3bf7f2a3")
	)
	(text "VB - BUS-SIDE VOLTAGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a21ef14d-cee8-5088-82db-87edf7a8bd5e")
	)
	(text "Linear +/-500 A, clip +/-640 A (OC trip 202 A, SC trip 405 A inside). 10 ohm + 10 nF input\nfilter (SBASA11B Fig 8-2). HGND on the shunt's X- bolt by its own trace. Fail-safe out = -2.57 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 318.868 99.184 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd37a83e-737e-5c2c-86fa-fdd3a63dd323")
	)
	(text "HOLD-CLOSED LOGIC, CHANNEL 2 (IRFL214 LOW SIDE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 206.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c776a50b-da4a-5c6c-8252-6d7a9bf0f8c2")
	)
	(text "100 k / 15 k -> Schmitt buffer T (ch1 side A). T -> 47 k / 22 uF -> T_d (ch1 side B). One-shots\n(3.3 uF / 47 k) of T -> T2A (ch2 side A) and of T_d -> T2B (ch2 side B). No single fault trips both\nchannels for longer than one one-shot. Firmware runs it at every start, contactor open and closed\n(report sec. 7.4: windows, what it finds and what it does not)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 370.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f9175bc9-3dad-57c0-8b48-2b57b620e14f")
	)
